#4471 merged every date report into one known issue. The cause table does not agree. A day-first tenant hits `parser` when the shared parser reads the date month first. A report that came in on booking-v3's form is `hint`: that form prints a month-first hint, and the form then reads the field the tenant's way. Those are different bugs. The hint reports moved off this ticket onto a ticket of their own.

<Callout kind="warn">
One desk ticket is not one problem. File one ticket per cause. Take the count from the table, not from the merged total.
</Callout>

